Converter per platform (converter/ in each bundle)
--------------------------------------------------
Each platform's bundle carries the x2t converter and its libraries exactly as
euro-office-lite's own installer for the pinned release ships them:
- linux-x64:    Euro-Office-Lite_<release>_amd64.deb   (ONLYOFFICE core 8.2.0)
- darwin-x64:   Euro-Office-Lite_<release>_x86_64.dmg  (ONLYOFFICE core 8.2.0)
- darwin-arm64: Euro-Office-Lite_<release>_aarch64.dmg (ONLYOFFICE core 8.2.0)
- win32-x64:    Euro-Office-Lite_<release>_x64-setup.exe (ONLYOFFICE core 9.4)
All from https://github.com/delmarguillen/euro-office-lite/releases at the
pinned release. Their corresponding source is ONLYOFFICE's core
(https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/core) at those versions, as built by that
project; the Windows converter is a newer ONLYOFFICE build than the others,
so it can read and write a few more formats. The macOS files are re-signed by
YouCoded's own app build; their content is unchanged.

Microsoft Visual C++ runtime (win32-x64 converter/ only)
--------------------------------------------------------
vcruntime140.dll, vcruntime140_1.dll and msvcp140.dll, unmodified, placed
beside x2t.exe because the converter needs them and a fresh Windows PC does
not have them. Copyright Microsoft Corporation. Redistributed as Microsoft's
Visual C++ "Distributable Code" permits (app-local deployment); they are
not covered by this repo's AGPL licence.

